# Fault refusal_outranks_hole (writer 6): crps of a distribution printed the observation's hole though the
# distribution is refused. L §5.11: "Refusals outrank holes: when both reach a result, the result is refused"; L §5.16:
# "An invalid parameter is refused at that key" (normal with sd = -1: RUN-PARAM); the observation o is a hole rule.
=== p17.tally
model p17
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-01-31

source s "synthetic"

input sd: num

def o: num
  rule base = ?"the observation isn't printed"

ask q: crps(normal(0, sd), o) to 0.001 law 2026-01-31 orient lower

version v1
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  sd = -1 "row"
=== expect
q: refused: RUN-PARAM normal parameter s = -1 is invalid
  law date 2026-01-31, cut 2026-01-31
  orient lower
